---
source: misc/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"whereis\")"
---
Locate the binary, source, and manual page files for a command

Usage: whereis [OPTIONS] [NAME]...

Arguments:
  [NAME]...  Command names to look up

Options:
  -b            Search for binaries only
  -m            Search for manuals only
  -s            Search for sources only
  -u            Only show unusual entries
  -l            List effective lookup paths
  -g            Interpret names as glob patterns
  -B <DIRS>...  Define binary lookup path
  -M <DIRS>...  Define manual lookup path
  -S <DIRS>...  Define source lookup path
  -f            Terminate the -B, -M and -S lists
  -h, --help    Print help
